1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,100
In February, a report said the Hyundai

2
00:00:03,100 --> 00:00:05,874
Santa Cruz was being discontinued.

3
00:00:06,054 --> 00:00:07,877
Hyundai would not confirm it.

4
00:00:08,057 --> 00:00:09,408
Eight months later,

5
00:00:09,408 --> 00:00:12,324
Hyundai says the Santa Cruz continues for

6
00:00:12,324 --> 00:00:13,746
twenty twenty-seven.

7
00:00:13,926 --> 00:00:15,783
So which one is true?

8
00:00:15,963 --> 00:00:16,886
Both, in a way,

9
00:00:16,886 --> 00:00:19,347
and the numbers behind this little truck

10
00:00:19,347 --> 00:00:21,316
