11
00:00:21,496 --> 00:00:24,917
It sold twenty-five thousand units last year,

12
00:00:24,917 --> 00:00:27,958
and it is down twenty-eight percent this

13
00:00:27,958 --> 00:00:30,087
year, while its rival is up.

14
00:00:30,267 --> 00:00:32,612
Here is the real story.

15
00:00:32,962 --> 00:00:35,740
The Hyundai Santa Cruz is a compact

16
00:00:35,740 --> 00:00:38,597
pickup built on the same platform as

17
00:00:38,597 --> 00:00:41,216
the Tucson, with a four foot bed,

18
00:00:41,216 --> 00:00:43,676
and it has always been a small,

19
00:00:43,676 --> 00:00:45,501
odd, interesting truck.

20
00:00:45,681 --> 00:00:48,035
It is also a truck that Americans

21
00:00:48,035 --> 00:00:50,246
seem to like when they own one,

22
00:00:50,246 --> 00:00:52,171
and that they do not buy in

23
00:00:52,171 --> 00:00:53,170
large numbers.

24
00:00:53,350 --> 00:00:56,074
That gap between how owners feel and

25
00:00:56,074 --> 00:00:58,496
