27
00:00:59,980 --> 00:01:01,200
Our sources.

28
00:01:01,380 --> 00:01:05,128
Kelley Blue Book for twenty twenty-seven pricing,

29
00:01:05,128 --> 00:01:06,964
specs and owner ratings.

30
00:01:07,144 --> 00:01:09,130
The Philadelphia Inquirer,

31
00:01:09,130 --> 00:01:10,887
from October fifteenth,

32
00:01:10,887 --> 00:01:14,400
for the review and for Hyundai's confirmation.

33
00:01:14,580 --> 00:01:18,616
The Autopian, for the discontinuation report and

34
00:01:18,616 --> 00:01:20,130
the sales context.

35
00:01:20,310 --> 00:01:23,688
And Autoevolution for the third quarter sales.

36
00:01:23,868 --> 00:01:26,003
Where two sources disagree,

37
00:01:26,003 --> 00:01:27,189
we will say so.

38
00:01:27,369 --> 00:01:29,124
And there are a few places where

39
00:01:29,124 --> 00:01:29,563
they do.

40
00:01:29,913 --> 00:01:31,724
Four twists are coming.

41
00:01:31,904 --> 00:01:33,866
A report that said it was dead.

42
00:01:34,046 --> 00:01:36,554
A confirmation that says it lives.

43
00:01:36,734 --> 00:01:39,093
A sales gap so large that one

44
00:01:39,093 --> 00:01:41,941
rival sold more hybrids in a single

45
00:01:41,941 --> 00:01:44,790
quarter than the Santa Cruz sold in

46
00:01:44,790 --> 00:01:45,766
nine months.

47
00:01:45,946 --> 00:01:48,506
And a replacement that is not coming

48
00:01:48,506 --> 00:01:50,497
until the end of the decade.

49
00:01:50,677 --> 00:01:52,303
Let us start with the report.

50
00:01:52,653 --> 00:01:54,696
Part one, the report.

51
00:01:54,876 --> 00:01:57,054
According to The Autopian,

52
00:01:57,054 --> 00:02:00,656
