55
00:02:05,191 --> 00:02:07,481
The truck was originally set to run

56
00:02:07,481 --> 00:02:10,753
through the second quarter of twenty twenty-seven.

57
00:02:10,933 --> 00:02:13,857
The reasons given were weak sales and

58
00:02:13,857 --> 00:02:15,042
