66
00:02:31,747 --> 00:02:34,979
Alabama plant, which also builds the Tucson.

67
00:02:35,159 --> 00:02:38,161
Kelley Blue Book wrote on February second

68
00:02:38,161 --> 00:02:41,017
that the Santa Cruz would reportedly be

69
00:02:41,017 --> 00:02:43,727
