81
00:03:12,045 --> 00:03:13,369
That is not a denial.

82
00:03:13,549 --> 00:03:15,685
It is also not a confirmation.

83
00:03:15,865 --> 00:03:18,338
It is a company choosing its words.

84
00:03:18,688 --> 00:03:20,847
Part two, the confirmation.

85
00:03:21,027 --> 00:03:24,337
In the Inquirer review from October fifteenth,

86
00:03:24,337 --> 00:03:26,856
