357
00:14:31,047 --> 00:14:33,455
versatility and rugged image.

358
00:14:33,635 --> 00:14:35,818
So the Santa Cruz may have done

359
00:14:35,818 --> 00:14:37,720
its job, even if it did not

360
00:14:37,720 --> 00:14:38,847
sell like a hit.

361
00:14:39,027 --> 00:14:41,433
It showed Hyundai that Americans would buy

362
00:14:41,433 --> 00:14:42,406
a Hyundai pickup.

363
00:14:42,586 --> 00:14:45,140
The next one is the real attempt.

364
00:14:45,490 --> 00:14:46,431
Should you buy one?

365
00:14:46,611 --> 00:14:48,193
If you want a small,

366
00:14:48,193 --> 00:14:51,199
stylish truck with a long warranty and

367
00:14:51,199 --> 00:14:52,781
you do not tow much,

368
00:14:52,781 --> 00:14:54,680
yes, with one condition.

369
00:14:54,860 --> 00:14:55,870
Discounts.

370
00:14:56,050 --> 00:14:58,596
Kelley Blue Book lists a deal on

371
00:14:58,596 --> 00:15:01,223
the SE that ends November second,

372
00:15:01,223 --> 00:15:04,326
with financing at three point four nine

373
00:15:04,326 --> 00:15:06,793
percent for up to sixty months,

374
00:15:06,793 --> 00:15:09,738
up to twelve hundred fifty dollars in

375
00:15:09,738 --> 00:15:12,364
cash savings, or a lease at three

376
00:15:12,364 --> 00:15:16,263
hundred forty-nine dollars a month for thirty-six

377
00:15:16,263 --> 00:15:16,820
months.

378
00:15:17,000 --> 00:15:19,194
Check whether it is still valid.

379
00:15:19,544 --> 00:15:20,449
If you tow,

