00:15:28,026 --> 00:15:30,024
If you want more capability,

384
00:15:30,024 --> 00:15:33,378
the Frontier tows nearly seven thousand pounds.

385
00:15:33,558 --> 00:15:35,499
And if you want a truck that

386
00:15:35,499 --> 00:15:37,926
will keep its parts and service for

387
00:15:37,926 --> 00:15:40,631
years, remember that an orphan truck is

388
00:15:40,631 --> 00:15:41,116
a risk.

389
00:15:41,296 --> 00:15:44,210
Hyundai says the Santa Cruz continues.

390
00:15:44,390 --> 00:15:46,561
But the company has not promised a

391
00:15:46,561 --> 00:15:47,710
second generation.

392
00:15:48,060 --> 00:15:50,649
Let us compare two numbers from the

393
00:15:50,649 --> 00:15:53,755
