394
00:15:53,755 --> 00:15:54,051
lot.

395
00:15:54,231 --> 00:15:57,704
The Maverick sold one hundred fifty-five thousand

396
00:15:57,704 --> 00:16:00,752
and fifty-one trucks in twenty twenty-five,

397
00:16:00,752 --> 00:16:03,942
and the Santa Cruz sold twenty-five thousand,

398
00:16:03,942 --> 00:16:05,714
four hundred ninety-nine.

399
00:16:05,894 --> 00:16:08,610
When one truck sells six times as

400
00:16:08,610 --> 00:16:09,927
many as another,

401
00:16:09,927 --> 00:16:13,056
the smaller one gets fewer dealers who

402
00:16:13,056 --> 00:16:14,208
