403
00:16:14,208 --> 00:16:16,760
fewer used examples to compare,

404
00:16:16,760 --> 00:16:18,572
and fewer accessories.

405
00:16:18,752 --> 00:16:20,512
That is not a flaw in the

406
00:16:20,512 --> 00:16:20,934
truck.

407
00:16:21,114 --> 00:16:23,314
It is the cost of being small

408
00:16:23,314 --> 00:16:25,665
in a market that rewards scale.

409
00:16:26,016 --> 00:16:27,838
Now the engine choice.

410
00:16:28,018 --> 00:16:30,669
The base Santa Cruz has one hundred

411
00:16:30,669 --> 00:16:33,925
