424
00:17:00,900 --> 00:17:03,059
But the turbo costs money.

425
00:17:03,239 --> 00:17:05,733
Kelley Blue Book lists the SE at

426
00:17:05,733 --> 00:17:09,707
thirty-one thousand, nine hundred fifty dollars and

427
00:17:09,707 --> 00:17:12,123
the XRT at forty-four thousand,

428
00:17:12,123 --> 00:17:14,071
four hundred twenty-five.

429
00:17:14,251 --> 00:17:16,102
That is a long climb for a

430
00:17:16,102 --> 00:17:18,024
truck with a four foot bed.

431
00:17:18,204 --> 00:17:21,366
A buyer should ask honestly whether the

432
00:17:21,366 --> 00:17:23,150
extra power is needed.

433
00:17:23,330 --> 00:17:25,371
If you want performance,

434
00:17:25,371 --> 00:17:26,987
the XRT is the one.

435
00:17:27,167 --> 00:17:28,501
If you want a small,

436
00:17:28,501 --> 00:17:31,567
stylish truck for commuting and light hauling,

437
00:17:31,567 --> 00:17:34,034
the lower trims already cover most of

438
00:17:34,034 --> 00:17:35,701
what the truck does well.

439
00:17:36,051 --> 00:17:37,935
Here is how to check the deal

440
00:17:37,935 --> 00:17:39,754
that Kelley Blue Book lists.

441
00:17:39,934 --> 00:17:42,594
The offer on the SE ends November

442
00:17:42,594 --> 00:17:45,979
second, with financing at three point four

443
00:17:45,979 --> 00:17:48,881
nine percent for up to sixty months,

444
00:17:48,881 --> 00:17:51,863
up to twelve hundred fifty dollars in

445
00:17:51,863 --> 00:17:53,878
cash savings, or a lease.

446
00:17:54,058 --> 00:17:56,888
Offers like this usually have conditions,

447
00:17:56,888 --> 00:17:59,236
and you often cannot combine them.

448
00:17:59,416 --> 00:18:01,901
Ask the dealer which offers apply to

449
00:18:01,901 --> 00:18:03,766
the exact truck on the lot,

450
00:18:03,766 --> 00:18:06,320
and ask for the out-the-door price in

451
00:18:06,320 --> 00:18:08,530
writing with each offer applied.

452
00:18:08,710 --> 00:18:09,801
Then compare.

453
00:18:10,151 --> 00:18:12,718
A common buyer mistake with a model

454
00:18:12,718 --> 00:18:14,993
that may be ending is to assume

455
00:18:14,993 --> 00:18:17,267
a big discount means a bargain.

456
00:18:17,447 --> 00:18:19,922
A discount can mean the dealer needs

457
00:18:19,922 --> 00:18:21,160
