458
00:18:21,160 --> 00:18:22,672
which is good for you.

459
00:18:22,852 --> 00:18:25,094
It can also mean the market values

460
00:18:25,094 --> 00:18:26,083
the truck less,

461
00:18:26,083 --> 00:18:27,995
which shows up when you sell.

462
00:18:28,175 --> 00:18:31,274
The Autopian said dealers held nearly five

463
00:18:31,274 --> 00:18:32,529
months of supply.

464
00:18:32,709 --> 00:18:34,223
So take the discount,

465
00:18:34,223 --> 00:18:36,242
but do not count it as proof

466
00:18:36,242 --> 00:18:38,478
that the truck is a great value

467
00:18:38,478 --> 00:18:39,199
over time.

468
00:18:39,549 --> 00:18:41,856
Warranty is where the Santa Cruz is

469
00:18:41,856 --> 00:18:43,240
