470
00:18:43,420 --> 00:18:46,718
Five years and sixty thousand miles basic,

471
00:18:46,718 --> 00:18:49,858
ten years and one hundred thousand miles

472
00:18:49,858 --> 00:18:51,350
for the powertrain.

473
00:18:51,530 --> 00:18:53,139
Before you rely on that,

474
00:18:53,139 --> 00:18:55,754
ask the dealer for the warranty booklet

475
00:18:55,754 --> 00:18:58,168
and read what it says about transfer

476
00:18:58,168 --> 00:19:00,582
to a second owner and about required

477
00:19:00,582 --> 00:19:01,387
maintenance.

478
00:19:01,567 --> 00:19:04,500
Warranties usually require that you follow the

479
00:19:04,500 --> 00:19:05,584
service schedule.

480
00:19:05,764 --> 00:19:07,378
Keep every receipt.

481
00:19:07,558 --> 00:19:09,536
If a claim ever comes up,

482
00:19:09,536 --> 00:19:12,306
the paperwork is what protects you.

483
00:19:12,657 --> 00:19:14,985
Let us compare the Santa Cruz with

484
00:19:14,985 --> 00:19:16,835
the Ridgeline for a moment,

485
00:19:16,835 --> 00:19:19,506
since they are the two car-like trucks.

486
00:19:19,686 --> 00:19:23,418
The Ridgeline sold thirty-seven thousand and twenty-eight

487
00:19:23,418 --> 00:19:25,840
through September, and it is growing.

488
00:19:26,020 --> 00:19:28,829
The Santa Cruz sold fourteen thousand,

489
00:19:28,829 --> 00:19:31,860
eight hundred eleven and it is shrinking.

490
00:19:32,040 --> 00:19:34,803
Both are comfortable and unconventional.

491
00:19:34,983 --> 00:19:37,635
So the market is not rejecting the

492
00:19:37,635 --> 00:19:38,024
idea.

493
00:19:38,204 --> 00:19:40,732
It is choosing which version it likes,

494
00:19:40,732 --> 00:19:42,860
and right now it is choosing the

495
00:19:42,860 --> 00:19:43,592
other ones.

496
00:19:43,941 --> 00:19:46,195
So who is the Santa Cruz right

497
00:19:46,195 --> 00:19:46,496
for?

498
00:19:46,676 --> 00:19:49,191
A person who wants a small truck

499
00:19:49,191 --> 00:19:51,470
that drives like a crossover,

500
00:19:51,470 --> 00:19:52,727
who tows little,

501
00:19:52,727 --> 00:19:54,456
who likes the styling,

502
00:19:54,456 --> 00:19:56,892
and who values a long warranty.

503
00:19:57,072 --> 00:19:59,144
Someone who will keep it for years

504
00:19:59,144 --> 00:20:01,093
and does not worry about what it

505
00:20:01,093 --> 00:20:02,007
is worth later.

506
00:20:02,187 --> 00:20:03,243
Who should wait?

507
00:20:03,423 --> 00:20:05,072
Anyone who tows a lot,

508
00:20:05,072 --> 00:20:07,770
anyone who cares about fuel economy,

509
00:20:07,770 --> 00:20:10,243
and anyone who wants to know what

510
00:20:10,243 --> 00:20:11,817
Hyundai will do next.

511
00:20:11,997 --> 00:20:14,560
For them, the Maverick or a future

512
00:20:14,560 --> 00:20:16,293
Hyundai may fit better.

513
00:20:16,642 --> 00:20:18,578
One more way to use what we

514
00:20:18,578 --> 00:20:19,510
have covered.

515
00:20:19,690 --> 00:20:22,267
Write down the three things that matter

516
00:20:22,267 --> 00:20:24,183
most to you in a small truck.

517
00:20:24,363 --> 00:20:26,347
For some people it is price,

518
00:20:26,347 --> 00:20:28,331
for some it is fuel economy,

519
00:20:28,331 --> 00:20:30,314
and for others it is the bed

520
00:20:30,314 --> 00:20:31,306
or the towing.

521
00:20:31,486 --> 00:20:33,845
Then score the Santa Cruz and the

522
00:20:33,845 --> 00:20:36,060
Maverick against your own list,

523
00:20:36,060 --> 00:20:38,347
using the figures in this video.

524
00:20:38,527 --> 00:20:40,630
The truck that wins on your list

