526
00:20:41,748 --> 00:20:44,639
whatever the headlines say about which model

527
00:20:44,639 --> 00:20:45,296
is ending.

528
00:20:45,646 --> 00:20:47,733
So what should you check before you

529
00:20:47,733 --> 00:20:48,746
buy a Santa Cruz?

